	text: [
		"Mesothelioma is a disease added by Nuclear Tech Mod. ",
		"",
		"It's caused by prolonged inhalation of asbestos particles. Asbestos Sheet or Asbestos Powder irradiate these sort of particles and will damage your lungs. ",
		"",
		"When you are exposed to a lung hazard, a pop up on the top right of your screen will tell you that its harder to breath, this indicates your lungs are being damaged by airborne particles.",
		"",
		"To counteract the lung damage, you can equip a Gas Mask with a filter that has the Airborne Particle trait to protect from  asbestos particle.",
		"",
		"Using SiOX Cancer Medication or Herbal Paste will partially heal the disease, from which it will heal in about an hour.",
		"",
		"To check the status of your lungs, you can use the Lung Diagnostic item, it will tell you how much asbestos or coal damage your lungs have taken.",
		"",
		"(This modpack has added a recipe for the Lung Diagnostic item, being made with: 1 copper ingot, 2 copper wire, 2 iron ingot, 1 steel, 1 integrated circuit board, coal powder, and asbestos powder)."
